        "func": "// backyard door OPEN  -> force living room off\n// door CLOSED -> emit nothing; the 06:00-19:59 cron restores heat within 60 s\nif (msg.payload !== \"on\") { return null; }\nmsg.topic   = \"climate.livingroom_thermostat\";\nmsg.payload = \"off\";\nreturn msg;\n",
